From: Automation Platform controller <controller@pipefail.dev>
Subject: [PATCH 0005] adopt orphans; org-less inventories become unrepresentable

Implements: ADR-0001 increment 3 (CTL-040 I1; design in
docs/design/ADR-0001-increment-3-note.md).

Data migration adopts every existing organization-NULL Inventory / Project /
WorkflowJobTemplate into a leased `recovered-orphans` organization (30-day
lease, so the graveyard clears itself through the ordinary lease GC), then
main_inventory.organization_id goes NOT NULL at the database level: the
SET_NULL-vs-reaper race turns into a loud IntegrityError on the org delete,
which the deletion state machine already retries. Project and
WorkflowJobTemplate share main_unifiedjobtemplate with JobTemplate (whose
organization is legitimately NULL), so their guarantee is operational: the
deletion pump adopts any stray org-NULL row into recovered-orphans each tick.

Tested by: migration rehearsal on the live database + tripwire + the loud-
race semantics documented in the design note.

